**4.9.15: This Thursday is Spartronics Day - Team 4915!**

For 49 minutes and 15 seconds starting at 4:40 pm on Thursday look for Spartronics teammates in the bright blue and yellow shirts.

Will be outside ACE Hardware, Town & Country Markets, Westside Pizza, the Ferry Terminal and Safeway -- and we're bringing our 2014 Championship robot ATLaS to the Pavilion!

We will also be stopping by to visit some of our great sponsors including Mr. Shutt at Johansson Clark Real Estate and Matt Makowicz at Bainbridge Homes Real Estate.

**Our goal is to celebrate STEM education and robotics in our schools** and raise awareness about the benefits of FIRST robotics, as well as funds for the World Championships in St. Louis in two weeks.

![ACEbuckets](../../assets/posts/help-us-raise-funds-for-worlds-and-celebrate-stem-in-the-community/ACEbuckets.jpg)These Buckets are for Bucks, courtesy of our outstanding sponsor, ACE Hardware. For every $1 or more you give, we will give you a Spartronics sticker.
